# The first launch's end-to-end test (quizbuks-web/e2e/first-launch, F-LAUNCH Q4), on top of app.env: read by CI (job
# e2e-first-launch in .github/workflows/quizbuks.yml) and the local run (tools/quizbuks/e2e.sh first-launch). The
# configuration (JABIZ_FIRST_LAUNCH_CONFIG) is made by tools/quizbuks/first-launch-e2e-config.sh; there is no first
# administrator. LOCAL AND CI ONLY.

# The waiting phase's job every ten seconds instead of every minute (a run is still at most one per
# jabiz.jobs.lock-at-least-for, 30 seconds): the invitations and the grants come sooner.
JABIZ_FIRST_LAUNCH_CRON='*/10 * * * * *'
